       {
        "p": 778,
        "end": 1035,
        "text": "Full-stack developer with 8+ years of experience building web products from the database schema to the finished UI. I work mostly in TypeScript, React and Node.js on AWS, and I focus on fast pages, clear APIs and code the next engineer can pick up quickly.\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1035,
        "end": 1046,
        "text": "EXPERIENCE\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1046,
        "end": 1073,
        "text": "Senior Full-Stack Engineer\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1073,
        "end": 1131,
        "text": "Company Name   |   San Francisco, CA   |   2022 \u2013 Present\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1131,
        "end": 1249,
        "text": "Led the migration of the customer dashboard from a legacy SPA to Next.js, cutting median page load from 3.1s to 1.8s.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 1249,
        "end": 1357,
        "text": "Designed a GraphQL gateway over 14 internal services that now serves 2M+ requests per day at 99.95% uptime.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 1357,
        "end": 1456,
        "text": "Added preview environments to every pull request, so QA review went from two days to the same day.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 1456,
        "end": 1477,
        "text": "Full-Stack Developer\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1477,
        "end": 1521,
        "text": "Company Name   |   Remote   |   2019 \u2013 2022\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1521,
        "end": 1627,
        "text": "Built a billing and invoicing module in Node.js and PostgreSQL that processes $4M in payments each month.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 1627,
        "end": 1743,
        "text": "Replaced a nightly batch job with an event-driven pipeline on AWS Lambda and SQS, so reports update within minutes.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 1743,
        "end": 1835,
        "text": "Mentored 8 junior engineers through code review, pairing and a weekly frontend study group.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 1835,
        "end": 1853,
        "text": "Software Engineer\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1853,
        "end": 1902,
        "text": "Company Name   |   Oakland, CA   |   2017 \u2013 2019\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 1902,
        "end": 2009,
        "text": "Shipped the first React Native release of the mobile app, which reached 50k installs in its first quarter.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 2009,
        "end": 2086,
        "text": "Wrote the Playwright end-to-end suite that runs before every weekly release.\n",
        "bullet": true
       },
       {
        "p": 2086,
        "end": 2104,
