        "text": "API Starter CLI   TypeScript  \u00b7  Node.js\n",
        "bullet": false
       },
       {
        "p": 2145,
        "end": 2254,
        "text": "An open-source tool that scaffolds API services with auth, logging and tests built in. 1.2k stars on GitHub.\n",
